---

#### 2. File `backend/.env.example`
Menyediakan acuan environment variable untuk pengembang lain:

```env
# Server Config
PORT=5000
NODE_ENV=development

# Database Config (SQLite)
DATABASE_URL="file:./prisma/dev.db"

# Authentication Config
JWT_SECRET="ganti_dengan_secret_key_bebas_kamu"

# External API Config
QURAN_API_URL="https://equran.id/api/v2"